<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">During the three months ended June 30, 2026, <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c1355"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c1356"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c1357"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c1358">none</span></span></span></span> of the Company's directors or officers (as defined in Rule 16a-1(f) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934) adopted, terminated or modified a Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement or non-Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement (as such terms are defined in Item 408 of Regulation S-K).</p>
